# ============================================================================
# .gitignore - Ca-Sr-O repository
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALLOWLIST strategy: everything is ignored by default and files are un-ignored
# one by one. This is deliberate: the working folder holds copyrighted paper
# PDFs, full transcriptions of those papers, and material from other projects.
# An "ignore the bad ones" list breaks the moment a new file shows up; this
# one does not.
#
# To add a file to the repo: write its !rule below.
# ============================================================================

# Ignore everything, including the contents of any subfolder
*
*/

# --- Repository documentation ------------------------------------------------
!README.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE-DATA.md
!CITATION.cff
!.gitignore

# --- The database ------------------------------------------------------------
!CaSrO.TDB
!CaSrO_opt.tdb
!CaSrO_opt_liq.tdb

# --- Thermo-Calc macros (they reproduce the work) ----------------------------
!validar_CaSrO.TCM
!optimizar_CaSrO_PARROT.TCM
!diagrama_CaSrO_opt.TCM
!comparar_experimental.TCM
!CaSrO.POP

# --- Experimental data taken from the literature -----------------------------
# Measured points with their citation: publishable. The articles they come
# from are not.
!ca_o_liquidus_solubility.csv
!halite_tielines_1100K.csv
!datos_experimentales_parrot.md
# Digitized by hand from the paper figures, provenance given in the header
!experimental_CaSrO.EXP

# --- Own diagrams exported from Console Mode (DATAPLOT format) ---------------
# Output of calculations made with this same database: these are results, not
# experimental data. The two configurations of README section 7.
!dos.exp
!diagrama tc.exp

# --- Own scripts -------------------------------------------------------------
!actividad_CaO_SrO.py
!anadir_laguna.py
!comparar_bases.py
!liquidus_CaO_SrO.py
!exportar_diagrama.py
!plot_beautiful_CaSrO.py
!plot_beautiful_CaSrO_CaO.py
!plot_dG_halita.py
!plot_full_CaSrO_diagram.py
!plot_optimized_CaSrO_diagram.py
!plot_optimized_results.py

# --- Figures produced by those scripts ---------------------------------------
!actividad_raoult_henry.png
!comparacion_bases.png
!dG_halita_laguna.png
!diagrama_CaSrO_completo.png
!diagrama_CaSrO_optimizado.png
!liquidus_comparacion.png
!resultado_optimizacion_CaSrO.png

# --- Tabulated results -------------------------------------------------------
!diagrama_CaSrO.csv
!diagrama_CaSrO_completo.csv

# ============================================================================
# DO NOT PUBLISH - listed explicitly even though the "*" rule already covers
# them, so the reason stays on record:
#
#   *.pdf                      copyrighted articles (Elsevier, Wiley, ACerS)
#   risold1997.md              full transcription of the 1997 paper
#   Sistema Ca-O/              full transcription + figures, Deffrennes 2020
#   sistema Sr-O/              full transcription + figures, Risold 1996
#   jacob2000/  jacob1998/     full transcription + figures, Jacob
#   papers/                    same, deffrennes2020 and zhang2016
#   guia_escribir_tdb.*        derived from the TCS Database Manager User Guide
#   guia_parrot.*              same
#   CaSrO_opt.PAR              binary PARROT workspace, 64 MB
#   ca-o.exp                   export of a calculation with IONIC_LIQ
#                              (a commercial database)
#   map 1.exp                  same, IONIC_LIQ#1/#2: belongs to the slag project
#   CaSrO_exp.exp              empty template generated by PARROT's COMPILE
#   diagrama FT.png            screenshot of a diagram computed with FactSage
#   comparar_FactSage.py       digitizes that screenshot; useless without it
#   comparacion_FactSage_halita.png  the overlay reproduces the third-party curve
#   Projects/                  industrial slag project, unrelated
#   MD/  MEMORY/               agent working notes
#   log/  revision_*.md        session logs
#   borradores/  respaldos/    intermediate versions
# ============================================================================
